        <h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(30px,4.2vw,46px);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#FBF8F1;margin-bottom:36px;">Executive team building, answered plainly.</h2>
